null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A caster leader in the Dublinn forces. Their Originium Arts do not stand out, but the innovative breakthrough of the casters under their command in mass-producing Arts-resistant masks has granted them considerable recognition from their leader.","abilities":["Refraction"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.1,"stats":{"hp":6500,"atk":460,"def":150,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"dublinn_sniffer_hound_pro":{"slug":"dublinn_sniffer_hound_pro","name":"Dublinn Sniffer Hound Pro","icon":"/enemies-icons/Dublinn Sniffer Hound Pro.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An organism controlled by the Dublinn forces, they are stronger in combat than the average Hound. They were originally purchased from a mercenary group, and have undergone training for a longer period. Equipped with a refractive mask crafted by Shadowcasters, they are rather resistant to regular Originium Arts.","abilities":["Refraction"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.7,"stats":{"hp":4000,"atk":380,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.4}},"dublinn_sniper_leader":{"slug":"dublinn_sniper_leader","name":"Dublinn Sniper Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/Dublinn Sniper Leader.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A sniper leader in the Dublinn forces. The crossbows they wield bear the signs of Columbian modification and have much greater penetration power. Equipped with a refractive mask crafted by Shadowcasters, they are rather resistant to regular Originium Arts.","abilities":["Refraction"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.1,"stat