s"],"flavourText":"A leader of a special squad that uses flamethrowers in the Dublinn forces. Their leader's teachings reverberate in their minds as they seek to reforge Terra amidst the endless flames.","abilities":["Continuously deals Arts damage and Burn for the skill duration","Upon death, explodes and deals Arts damage, knocking down nearby Tattered Pillars and instantly defeating other <Dublinn Flamerazers>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":600,"def":550,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"enraged_tombkeeper_grotesque":{"slug":"enraged_tombkeeper_grotesque","name":"Enraged Tombkeeper Grotesque","icon":"/enemies-icons/Enraged Tombkeeper Grotesque.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Arts Creation","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical","Arts"],"flavourText":"A special Arts creation from the Dublinn forces, created by their leader Mandragora. According to Mandragora, back when she was studying Originium Arts in an outskirts cemetery, the Tombkeeper Grotesque was her first companion. Its outer appearance has gone through many redesigns, with the latest being based off a Sarkaz from an ancient bloodline. This series of Tombkeepers embodies Mandragora's fury towards Victoria.","abilities":["After first defeat, temporarily transforms into a stone statue with extremely high DEF, then revives as an aerial unit","Refraction"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":750,"def":750,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"dublinn_elite_companion_guard":{"slug":"dublinn_elite_companion_guard","name":"Dublinn Elite Companion Guard","icon":"/enemies-icons/Dublinn Elite Companion Guard.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A member of the Dublinn forces' elite operations squad, they are much stronger than regular squad members. The shields they wield are the culmination of many nations' technologies, providing cover for their partners while advancing, and protecting all nearby allies from harm.","abilities":["More likely to get attacked by your units","When a <Dublinn Elite Companion Shadowblade> is nearby, activates a field that reduces nearby allied units' ASPD","Refraction"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":20000,"atk":1100,"def":1000,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"dublinn_evocator_leader":{"slug":"dublinn_evocator_leader","name":"Dublinn Evocator Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/Dublinn Evocator Leader.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"An evocation caster leader in the Dublinn forces who can control fireballs, they are more adept at using Originium Arts than their underlings. Their leader's teachings reverberate in their minds as they work to purify the corruption of Terra in raging flames.","abilities":["Controls <Purifying Flames> that move along the ground and explode after hitting a melee ally unit, dealing Arts damage and Burn; damage dealt decreases with distance moved"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":20000,"atk":0,"def":550,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"mandragora":{"slug":"mandragora","name":"Mandragora","icon":"/enemies-icons/Mandragora.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"One of the leaders of the Dublinn forces, a caster who controls stone. Emerging from the darkness of Victoria, she has sworn to repay the humiliation she suffered at the hands of the nobles manyfold.","abilities":["[Stoneshield] R